    "type": "X_PRESET",
    "version": "1.1",
    "description": "VRM 1.0 humanBones slot names + VRoid Studio (J_Bip_*). Separator/case variants are handled by fuzzy matching. Thumbs follow VRM 1.0 semantics (Metacarpal/Proximal/Distal); Unity Humanoid / VRM 0.x thumbs (Proximal/Intermediate/Distal) live in the VRChat preset instead -- the string 'ThumbProximal' means a different joint in each spec, so the two families must not share one file. For an arbitrary .vrm asset the authoritative mapping is the file's own humanBones table, not these names.",
    "category": "通用平台"
  },
